Licensing of kaltsit-cursors
===========================

Original cursor artwork
-----------------------

The original Windows artwork is "凯尔希 · 思衡托" by 一球咸鱼.
The ANI resources in assets/windows, the converted Xcursor image data in
theme/Kaltsit/cursors, and artwork in docs remain subject to the original
creator's rights. Arknights character/IP rights remain with their respective
rights holders. This is an unofficial fan adaptation.

On 2026-10-24, the creator granted the project maintainer permission to
submit a Linux adaptation to nixpkgs. The maintainer's request explicitly
promised attribution, a link to the original work, and non-commercial use.
The creator replied: "可以的，如果方便请在评论区也发一下".
The maintainer agreed to share installation instructions and the project
link in the original work's comments after submission; the creator agreed.
See CREDITS.md for the source and permission context.

This records a specific permission for this adaptation and its nixpkgs
submission. It is not a grant of an MIT, GPL, Creative Commons, or other
general-purpose free license for the artwork. It does not grant broader
reuse, commercial use, or sublicensing rights. No general right to
redistribute the unmodified Windows package is asserted here.

Conversion and packaging code
-----------------------------

The new Python tools, tests, shell installer, Nix expressions, manifest and
project documentation are licensed under the MIT License in LICENSE-MIT.
That license does not cover the original artwork or its converted images.
